{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_jaksel_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_jaksel_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "无价的勋章",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_jaksel_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b4e7ed7769be8b6638be8493f5a6450fba76c6afaeffa964d537bca2fd815871",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的记者",
      "text": "你好！麻烦看下这边可以吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的记者",
      "text": "你对此事不做任何回应是代表了官方的态度吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无礼的记者",
      "text": "请不要回避我们的镜头。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无礼的记者",
      "text": "你在此之前是否对此事知情呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "杰克警官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "事实已经摆在了这里，请正面回答！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不久之前"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "嗬！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "杰克，原来你在这里，我还一直在找你呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "哇啊啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "杰克干员，你是不是有点太兴奋了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "对不起对不起，你没事吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "有没有受伤！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "我没事，不过你自己倒是小心一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "作为即将接受表彰的救人英雄，可别在会议开始前弄伤自己了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "嘿嘿......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "你看你，衣服也弄得皱皱巴巴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "啊，没事没事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "你看！这样就好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "你这是又跑哪里去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "嘿嘿，其实我刚刚偷偷去了一趟会场，看见好多人都在那边忙碌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我顺手就帮他们一起把设备搬到了台子上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "你还帮忙一起干活去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "对啊！真的是特别沉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "而且啊......那个时候我站在台子上，就突然想起以前父亲每次参加授勋仪式的时候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我坐在下面看着他，周围的人都在鼓掌，但我会比他们拍得都响！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "所以父亲肯定能找到我坐的位置，就算他一脸严肃，也会偷偷地对我微笑一下......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "杰克，怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "这次是我要站在上面......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "可惜他在外执行任务，没有办法赶到现场。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "那他也一定会为你感到骄傲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "之后我要完完整整地讲给父亲听！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "对了，你跟我来一趟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "政府那边说，在会议开始前有一些事务必须和你本人确认一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "在那天如此紧急和危险的情况下，能够义无反顾地勇敢冲进现场并救出了那么多人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "真的是令人钦佩，杰克警官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "啊，其实我以前只是辅警......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "没有关系，你的情况我们已经和罗德岛沟通过了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "包括你的矿石病问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "在矿石病方面，罗德岛提供了相应的检测结果，没有错吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "不会有错，罗德岛对自己干员的健康检测是绝对负责的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "我们可以为此担保。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "哈哈，其实我个人是觉得，只要在身体表面没有明显的痕迹，这都不是太大问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "即便真的有人拿这件事做文章，我们也有相应的预案。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "预案？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "年轻警官，休假外出偶遇突发险情，救人过程中不幸意外感染矿石病。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "我们会这样对外解释。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "可如果这样的话......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "这只是最坏的一个可能性，当然我们不希望有任何的意外发生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "不管怎样，我们都认为你是我们哥伦比亚警察队伍里光荣的一员。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "就像你的父亲一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "唔......我还比不上我的父亲，他才是真正的警官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "那对你来说，这不是一次绝佳的机会吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "向你父亲证明自己也可以成为像他一样的英雄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "这份文件给你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "“请问你在冲进现场的那一刻，有想过自己的家人吗......”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "“听说你的父亲也是一名警察，所以他在事后是怎么评价你的行为的......”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "“请问你的身体恢复得如何，会影响之后的工作和生活吗......”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "所有的内容都要按照这个上面的说法去回答吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "可是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "我知道你有疑问，不过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "以最好的形象出现在媒体公众面前，才不会让你父亲失望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "你说对不对，杰克警官？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "警官......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "对，杰克警官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "这就是你的身份。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "这一次的表彰，不仅会彰显政府与警队的光荣形象。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "也是你个人的荣誉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "更是你父亲的荣耀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我知道了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "啊，我这就去收拾一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我一定会做好的，放心吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "另外，在会议开始前我会安排你去见一下这次被救者的代表。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "他非常感谢你能救他出来，说一定要在表彰会前见你一面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "唔......脸上应该没有脏东西了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "杰克，我需要提醒你一件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "政府那边实际上并没有向罗德岛提出正式将你重新聘回警队的要求。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "所以无论他刚刚怎么说，很有可能只是出于一些宣传上的需要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我衣服怎么样？后面呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "都挺好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "杰克，你听到我说的了吗？你现在太紧张了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "嗯......可这的确会是我第一次站在台上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "不知道为什么......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我总觉得父亲一定会坐在台下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "万一我真的说错了话或者做错了什么怎么办！他肯定一眼就能发现。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "可底下坐着那么多人，而我看不到他在哪里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我不知道父亲那时会是什么表情......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "他会很失望吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我知道，我现在还配不上警官这个称呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "所以就算不能回到警队也没有关系......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "把那份文件给我吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我还是想做到最好，就像父亲坐在那里一样！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "你好？是杰克警官吗？工作人员告诉我你在这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "不好意思打扰到你们，不过我想试试能不能在会议开始前，对你做一个简短的独家采访。可以吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "哦对了，这是我的证件，我是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "抱歉，我们现在还有点事情要处理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "等下在会上，会有留给记者的提问时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "只会耽误你们一点点时间！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "我刚刚听到你们提到一份文件，是你们手上的吗？抱歉我不是有意偷听的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "只是我有一些重要的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "杰克，我们走吧，那个人还等着我们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "欸，等一下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "对不起！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "等下会在会上认真回答你的问题的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "（我给所有人都讲过我父亲的故事，他很厉害！无论是抓坏人还是救人，没有任何事情能难倒他。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "（媒体上关于父亲的报道也是如此，他就是警队的模范！不过父亲却不喜欢我把关于他的报道和照片带在身边。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "（那些父亲帮助过的人我大多都认识......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "（他们总是会来拜访父亲，然后对我说，希望我成为和父亲一样的警察。这个时候父亲总是会说我还只是个辅警，还有很多东西要学。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "（说起来，我也从来没有真正见到过他得到的那些奖章，不知道父亲为什么不带回家里。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "（所以今天这枚奖章，应该会是我们家里面，摆放的第一枚奖章！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "获救者代表",
      "text": "杰克警官！是吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "获救者代表",
      "text": "就是你！我肯定不会认错！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "获救者代表",
      "text": "不过你肯定认不出我来了！那天我们所有人都是熏了一脸的灰，哈哈哈。",
