      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无礼的记者",
      "text": "稍等一下！麻烦这位警官站直一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无礼的记者",
      "text": "可以把衣服整理一下吗？谢谢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的记者",
      "text": "杰克警官，请问那天你在冲进现场的一瞬间，有想到过自己的家人吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的记者",
      "text": "现场的情况的危险程度，你肯定比我们所有人都要更清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的记者",
      "text": "杰克警官，请问那个时候你犹豫过吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长",
      "text": "哈哈哈，杰克警官刚刚经历了这么大一场事故，也是作为新人第一次接受表彰，有些紧张也是可以理解的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长",
      "text": "大家一个问题一个问题地来，不要着急。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长",
      "text": "说起来，她的父亲也是一位优秀的警官，也曾站在这里接受过表彰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长",
      "text": "我还记得那个时候他也和你一样，有些局促不安，哈哈哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "嗯，我虽然那个时候还小，但我记得很清楚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "那也是很多年前了，父亲还是这里地方警局的一名普通警察。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "那次是他在执勤的时候......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的记者",
      "text": "杰克警官？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我觉得我做的事情，只是出于一名警察的责任。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我没有时间，而且当时的情况......也不允许我有任何的犹豫，毕竟哪怕只是多拖延一分一秒，对于里面的被困者都是非常危险的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "在冲进现场的那一瞬间......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我也的确想起过我的父亲，但更多是想到他对我的鼓励......和期许。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "这让我更加坚定，一定要把被困者救出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的记者",
      "text": "既然你提到了你的父亲，那请问他知道你所做的事情之后，是如何评价的呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我的父亲作为警察，此刻依旧奋斗在岗位上......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我很遗憾他不能亲自来到现场。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "但我想，他一定会为我感到骄傲和自豪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的记者",
      "text": "所以请问这是你加入警队的原因吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的记者",
      "text": "成为一名警察去帮助别人，去向你父亲证明自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "其实......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我并不是因为加入了警队才会去帮助其他人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "就像我的父亲，他......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长",
      "text": "咳咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "获救者代表",
      "text": "哦哦。",
