    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "所以本来就应该是这样的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "父亲他也需要这样去做吗？按照他们的要求......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "杰克，这只是一次宣传。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "他们给你额外强加的身份，他们让你回答的内容，都只是他们需要的宣传。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "但是其实你并不需要这些去证明什么，罗德岛上的每一个人都知道你是一个热心善良的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "大家也知道你的父亲是毋庸置疑的英雄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "如果你真的......无法接受，你可以选择现在离开。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "后续的事情会由罗德岛来处理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "不行！我不会就这么离开。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我在意的不是宣传或者这些荣誉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我......我可以去做！真的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "那你在意的是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "“成为一名真正的警察，成为我的孩子和市民的榜样。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "所有我在台下听到的那些话......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "他真的......是这样想的吗？他真的是想对我说这些吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "既然如此......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "你救了人，这是事实。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "那无论他们怎么安排，这枚勋章都理应颁发给你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "回去吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "回去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
