      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长",
      "text": "我代表全体政府官员，警队的全体成员......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长",
      "text": "还有全体获救者及其家属......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长",
      "text": "向在此次事故搜救中表现突出的杰克警官，授予杰出英勇勋章。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长",
      "text": "希望你继续努力，作为政府和警察的杰出代表，继续为本市市民做出贡献。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "谢谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "等下，市长先生！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "我有话要问！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "你是什么人？！你的媒体邀请函呢？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "杰克警官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "作为那天唯一冲进现场的当事人，你是否认识这张照片上的人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "回答我的问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "这两个人，他们在现场已经遇难。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我试着救过他们......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "那你到底救出来了几个人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "四个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "他们在这张照片上面吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我不确定，当时情况太过混乱，我根本没有留意他们的长相。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "那这位代表，请问你认识照片上的人吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "获救者代表",
      "text": "我不认识。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "你不认识？！真的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "够了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "通知警察，把这个非法闯入者抓起来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "欸，这里不就有一位你们宣传的英雄警官吗，让她抓我啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "然后又是大功一件。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "杰克警官，抓住他！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "不，你继续说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "行啊，我看你准备装到什么时候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "媒体报道说，这次事故受到波及的是一家七口。而事故原因则是这家感染最深的二儿子，以及一些市长先生难以启齿的行动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长",
      "text": "你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "虽然官方没有公布长相，但我还是搞到了这家人的照片，就是这张。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "你确认了两名遇害者，然后又救出来了四个人，再加上二儿子，的确正好七个人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "可你身边这位获救者居然认不出照片上自己的家人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "什么？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "获救者代表",
      "text": "我只是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "获救者代表",
      "text": "我家里人没有出事！你为什么要逼问我这些！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "你到底想要问什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "这个人，刚刚经历了这么大的灾难和变故。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "你到底要做什么？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "因为你身边的这个人是个被开除的警察，这是他之前的档案记录。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "可是很奇怪，我居然没有找到杰克警官之前任何的警队记录。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "没有投诉，没有表彰，没有加班？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "你就这么巧合出现了，现场那么多警察只有你冲了进去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "哦，对了。你父亲是英雄啊，那如果英雄的女儿也是英雄呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "这么棒的宣传素材，哈哈哈！为了市长先生的选票和愈发糟糕的政府形象。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "我承认你的父亲的确是一名优秀的警察。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "可你真的是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "你真的，是警官吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的记者",
      "text": "杰克警官！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的记者",
      "text": "你对此事不做任何回应是代表了某种官方的态度吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无礼的记者",
      "text": "请不要回避我们的镜头。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无礼的记者",
      "text": "你在此之前是否对此事知情呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "杰克，我已经发讯息让罗德岛调查这件事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "你先不要说任何话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急切的记者",
      "text": "市长先生，请问他刚刚说的都是真的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长",
      "text": "所有你们听到的这些，都是无端指责！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长",
      "text": "这是对我们的英雄的无端中伤与亵渎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长",
      "text": "来人！把这个人抓住！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "抓住他！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "政府官员",
      "text": "啊！你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长",
      "text": "杰克警官，你在做什么！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我有事情要问他，你们不能带他走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "你们都让开！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "你要问什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "实话说，我也不知道今天到底发生了什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我只是很开心能看到自己救的人安然无恙地出现在这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "但刚刚你说这个获救者是假的，这一切都是安排的演出？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "难道不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我很清楚，那天的事故绝对不是伪造的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我救出来的人......那些在现场不幸遇难的人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "这绝不可能是假的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "所以真正的获救者在哪里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "我不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "你怎么会不知道？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "关我什么事，我又怎么知道他们为什么不能出现在这里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "你不是该问问安排了这一切的人吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "获救者代表",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "获救者代表",
      "text": "我什么也不知道，不要问我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "市长先生，这一切到底是怎么回事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长",
      "text": "杰克警官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长",
      "text": "你已经越界了，这不是你该管的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长",
      "text": "请注意你的身份，你代表的是本市的警察，也代表了你的父亲！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "记者",
      "text": "您好，请问您当时为什么会冲进去救人？面对那么多歹徒，您会害怕吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "记者",
      "text": "我听说有人指责正是因为您的鲁莽行动，才导致了之后歹徒的残忍暴行以及对被害者的伤害，请问您作何回应。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "记者",
      "text": "我听说您的孩子也是一名警察，请问如果是您被困在里面，您会希望她也采取和您一样的行动吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "text": "其实我觉得这样的提问完全没有必要，甚至去报道这件事都完全没有必要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "text": "但是如果不得不做回应的话......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "text": "既然我能做到的话，那就不能见死不救。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "可我不是警官，我的父亲才是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "所以你承认了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我不配，代表我的父亲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "他是真正的英雄！不允许你们去质疑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "而现在，我只知道现在有四个人失踪了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我救了他们，他们应该出现在这里，但是现在他们不见了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "他们到底在哪里？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "独立记者",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "获救者代表",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "市长先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "回答我的问题，不然的话......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市长",
      "text": "你敢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "哼哼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "咦，是在这里吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "我查过了，那四名获救的人的确是在这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "因为他们都在那场事故里感染了矿石病，所以......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "所以哪怕是在哥伦比亚，政府也不希望他们出现在公共场合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "毕竟这场事故的起因对政府来说，也不是什么光彩的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "“年轻警官，休假外出偶遇突发险情，救人途中不幸意外感染矿石病。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "不管怎么样，他们都能编造出合理的说辞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "只不过这一次，你恰好是最合适的素材。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "他们会没事吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "在后续和当地政府的医疗合作中，我们会争取为他们安排治疗的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "虽然这次这么一闹，可能会有点困难。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "啊！对不起！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "我当时......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "这不是你的错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "实话说，刚刚被派驻到哥伦比亚的这个地方，然后就在这么危险的事故中，奋不顾身救出四个人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "博士如果知道了，也一定会特别开心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "辛苦了，杰克干员。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "嗯？这枚奖章你还留着吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "毕竟我还要给父亲讲这个故事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰克",
      "text": "嘿嘿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
